  m_text: "Key Mapping\n\t\tPlayer 1:\t\t\tPlayer 2:\nJump: \tW\t\t\t\tUp Arrow\nLeft:\t\tA\t\t\t\tLeft
    Arrow\nRight:\t\tD\t\t\t\tRight Arrow\nSoft Hit:\tspace\t\t\tEnter / Left mouse
    click\nHard Hit:\tC\t\t\tBackspace / Right mouse click\n\nUse any player control
    in Single Player mode\n\nPower-ups\nBlue: \t\t\tRotate your opponent's field
    downwards for 10s\nGreen: \t\tIncrease your player size for this round\nYellow:
    \t\tDecrease your opponent's size for this round\n\nActivate the powerup by hitting
    the floating bubble with the ball or touching it yourself\n\nHAVE FUN!!!\n(we
    suggest you to play multiplayer mode since the AI is not polished right now...)"
